Package: m6APrediction
Title: Prediction of m6A RNA Modification Sites
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Shijin", "Yao",
           email = "3395426565@qq.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to encode DNA sequence features and predict
    N6-methyladenosine (m6A) modification sites in RNA using a trained
    random forest classification model. Supports predictions for multiple
    sequences and individual sites.
